# Template for fastlane/.env (copy to fastlane/.env and fill in — .env is gitignored).
# Loaded automatically by fastlane's dotenv support.
#
# BaliSurf ships Android/Play only for now. The Play lanes read the service
# account key from a gitignored play-service-account.json in the repo root
# (local) or base64 in PLAY_JSON_KEY (CI) — neither belongs here.
#
# Optional knobs:
#   PLAY_VALIDATE_ONLY=1  Dry-run every supply upload (Play validates, discards).
#   PLAY_RELEASE_STATUS   draft (default) | completed — release visibility on upload.
#   PLAY_ROLLOUT          Staged-rollout fraction for play_promote (default 1.0).
#   PLAY_CLOSED_TRACK     Closed track name for play_closed (default alpha).
#   ANDROID_VERSION_CODE  Pin the versionCode (upload lanes derive it otherwise).
